      <activity id="128b87ab-4848-5ad2-9e69-6885d8c55189" activityNameId="cfaad2f3-0b94-5685-9487-4cda061694d6" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Biomethane, burned in boiler condensing modulating 50kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Biomethane, burned in boiler condensing modulating 50kW
Inventory for 1 MJ biomethane, burned in a gas boiler condensing modulating with a capacity of 50 kW for a multi- family house with 2100 operating hours.;
Synonyms: Biogas, aufbereitet, in Heizkessel kond. mod. 50kW; 
UUID: ff91110c-1656-34b1-a845-87ce7531e461
The module includes fuel input from (CH) network, infrastructure (boiler), emissions to air and water, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Data apply to the combustion in Switzerland.
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: This inventory is based on the natural gas, burned in boiler inventory and adjusted regarding the biomethane input and the biogenic CO, CO2 and CH4 emissions.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ff91110c-1656-34b1-a845-87ce7531e461.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
